        {
          "id": "b-25",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Clip Description: In DARK, Dark Freeman is a ticking time bomb, ready to explode. Desperate to find direction around all the obstacles in his life, Dark is lost and confused…and sinking fast. This film, gritty and low budget, succeeded with a grace and flair that gave the impression of a larger budget. Challenges like this keep film professionals on their toes and demand creative and cost-effective solutions to commonly expensive hurdles."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
