        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Clip Description: A nostalgic period film that was directed by acclaimed Writer and Director Mark Medoff. One of Faires’ first films as an A-Camera Operator and he says he was very fortunate to have the tutelage and guidance of Steve Shaw ASC. In Children on Their Birthdays, 12 year old Lily Bobbit moves to Medda, Alabama, and immediately makes an impression on the residents when she and her friends team up to outsmart a con man, changing the town forever."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
