            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "URL: [https://player.vimeo.com/video/1059224992?h=b8c7939362](https://player.vimeo.com/video/1059224992?h=b8c7939362)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-52",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Writers: Scott Neustadter (screenplay), Michael H. Weber (screenplay)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-53",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Stars: Steve Martin, Jean Reno, Emily Mortimer"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-54",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Project Description: The Pink Panther 2 is a 2009 American spy comedy film directed by Harald Zwart and written by Tom Shepherd and John Phillips. It is the second installment in the Pink Panther film series, and a prequel to the original 1963 film The Pink Panther."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-55",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Clip Description: Faires says he is still awed by the ensemble that he worked with on in this film! A big budget film that demanded a very focused approach. He kept very detailed records from day one and they helped immensely through out the project. Denis Crossan, who works under the British style, was very engaging and trusting in his work."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
