        {
          "id": "b-75",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Clip Description: The-Merry-Gentleman-crewThis was Faires’ first opportunity to work with acclaimed DoP Chris Seager, BSC. This was also Michael Keaton’s directorial debut. Faires says this was one of the most inclusive and collaborative experiences of his career. The three of them were very focused on Michael’s vision and Chris’ interpretation. The result was beautiful to observe."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
