              "type": "text",
              "text": "Clip Description: Game 3 Shooting action and fight sequences is a very visceral experience for Faires. He has had years of training in and exposure to many different forms of martial arts and this film let him experience it from his cameraman’s perspective. Giorgio Serafini and Eric Engineer believed and trusted in all of his abilities…"
